:R-HSA-111452  a            obo:GO_1901030 , owl:NamedIndividual ;
        rdfs:comment        "tBID binds to its mitochondrial partner BAK to release cytochrome c. Activated tBID results in an allosteric activation of BAK. This may induce its intramembranous oligomerization into a pore for cytochrome c efflux." ;
